.Rproj.user
/Meta/
.Rhistory
.Rdata
.httr-oauth
.DS_Store
.quarto
# man/figures is tracked: the README logo and pkgdown both read
# from it, so an untracked one is a broken image on GitHub.
logo_source.png
*.BiocCheck/
/doc/

Rplots.pdf
vignettes/figure/
# Knitting a vignette in place (RStudio's Knit button) leaves its .html beside
# the .Rmd. R CMD build would then ship that stale copy inside the package, so
# it is ignored here - the real vignette is built from the .Rmd into doc/.
vignettes/*.html
docs/
# pkgdown/ is tracked: it holds the favicons and extra.css the
# site is built from. The generated site itself is in docs/.
